{
 "release_cutoff": "initial release date >= 2023-07-01",
 "selection_notes": "Candidates: RCSB search (query below) -> 5156 entries; seeded random sample (seed 0, n=300) -> metadata via data.rcsb.org GraphQL + mmCIF via files.rcsb.org; post-filters on the mmCIF (gemmi): protein, no nonstandard residues, 60-300 modeled residues, >90% of SEQRES modeled, CA present for all modeled residues, no X/U in sequence (231/300 pass). Final 10 chosen by hand from the passing pool for fold/size diversity. Release cutoff 2023-07-01: the Boltz-2 repo docs (README/docs) state no training cutoff; the paper's cutoff (2023-06-01, from memory) is earlier, so 2023-07-01 is the later of the two. || EXTENSION (20 more cases, see manifest_extra.json): 20 additional cases drawn from the same filtered pool as manifest.json (RCSB search query, X-ray <= 2.5 A, initial release >= 2023-07-01, one polymer entity / one protein chain, then mmCIF post-filters: protein, no nonstandard residues, > 90% of SEQRES modeled, CA present for every modeled residue, no X/U in sequence). Sizes <= 300 come from the original seeded sample (validation/pool.json, seed 0, n=300; 221 passing, 10 already used excluded). That pool has at most one 300-residue entry, so the 300-400 bucket re-runs the identical query with only the size range changed (validation/query_300_400.json -> 2800 entries), seeded sample (seed 0, n=200, tools/validation/extend_pool.py) with the same post-filters (142 pass; validation/pool_300_400.json). Selection by hand for fold/size diversity: 5 x 60-120, 7 x 120-200, 5 x 200-300, 3 x 300-400 residues (SEQRES length). Redundancy control: UniProt accessions (data.rcsb.org, validation/uniprot.json) are pairwise distinct across all 30 cases (incl. the original 10), no two cases share a description keyword, and from the many same-protein series in the pool (fragment-screen / group depositions of nsp1, Mpro, endothiapepsin, carbonic anhydrase II, lysozyme, ...) at most one entry was considered. The original 10 are unchanged. There is no torch reference for these cases (data/<id>/ref does not exist); score against the experimental mmCIF. || V36 EXTENSION (round 2): 6 more chains of 380-500 residues, same RCSB query/post-filters with the size range changed (validation/query_380_500.json), seed-0 permutation of the sorted candidate ids, distinct UniProt from the 30 existing cases and from each other. See v36_extension.",
 "query_endpoint": "https://search.rcsb.org/rcsbsearch/v2/query",
 "query": {
  "query": {
   "type": "group",
   "logical_operator": "and",
   "nodes": [
    {
     "type": "terminal",
     "service": "text",
     "parameters": {
      "attribute": "rcsb_accession_info.initial_release_date",
      "operator": "greater_or_equal",
      "value": "2023-07-01T00:00:00Z"
     }
    },
    {
     "type": "terminal",
     "service": "text",
     "parameters": {
      "attribute": "exptl.method",
      "operator": "exact_match",
      "value": "X-RAY DIFFRACTION"
     }
    },
    {
     "type": "terminal",
     "service": "text",
     "parameters": {
      "attribute": "rcsb_entry_info.resolution_combined",
      "operator": "less_or_equal",
      "value": 2.5
     }
    },
    {
     "type": "terminal",
     "service": "text",
     "parameters": {
      "attribute": "rcsb_entry_info.polymer_entity_count",
      "operator": "equals",
      "value": 1
     }
    },
    {
     "type": "terminal",
     "service": "text",
     "parameters": {
      "attribute": "rcsb_entry_info.polymer_entity_count_protein",
      "operator": "equals",
      "value": 1
     }
    },
    {
     "type": "terminal",
     "service": "text",
     "parameters": {
      "attribute": "rcsb_entry_info.deposited_polymer_entity_instance_count",
      "operator": "equals",
      "value": 1
     }
    },
    {
     "type": "terminal",
     "service": "text",
     "parameters": {
      "attribute": "rcsb_entry_info.deposited_polymer_monomer_count",
      "operator": "range",
      "value": {
       "from": 60,
       "to": 300,
       "include_lower": true,
       "include_upper": true
      }
     }
    }
   ]
  },
  "return_type": "entry",
  "request_options": {
   "paginate": {
    "start": 0,
    "rows": 10000
   },
   "sort": [
    {
     "sort_by": "rcsb_accession_info.initial_release_date",
     "direction": "asc"
    }
   ]
  }
 },
 "sample": {
  "seed": 0,
  "n": 300,
  "script": "tools/validation/filter_cases.py"
 },
